  "instructions": [
    "Heat the sesame oil in an iron teppan over medium heat.",
    "Add the grilled scallions and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the soba noodles and cook for 2 minutes, stirring frequently.",
    "Add the blueberries, soy sauce, rice vinegar, and maple syrup, and stir to combine.",
    "Cook for an additional 2 minutes, or until the noodles are well coated.",
    "Season with salt and black pepper to taste.",
    "Transfer the noodles to a serving bowl.",
    "Sprinkle the toasted sesame seeds on top.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy."
